  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PIMS-10110 FARM+ in Costa Rica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: FARM+ in Costa Rica. As described in the project concept (PIF/child project concept note), this project aims to increase the adoption of sustainable and climate resilient agricultural practices in Costa Rica by unlocking of financial resources, reducing the use of harmful agrochemicals, in a manner that enhance ecosystems health.</narrative>
  </description>
